  "strategyNotes": [
    "「たしかに〜。だが〜」 concedes then pivots. The writer's real point is after だが.",
    "「その遠回り」: find the nearest thing described as a detour (一見遠回りに見える) and identify what it is (問い直す時間).",
    "「〜こそが〜なのかもしれない」 expresses a strong claim softened by かもしれない. It is still the thesis."
